globbing, indentation in place of braces, sigilless
one-letter variables ([1mi[0m, [1ms[0m, …), a [1m^[0m sigil for native [1mnum[0m (unsettled), YAML and myaml data
pattern matching, [1mhas ~.x[0m / [1mhas #.x[0m attributes, and [1m#n.WHAT[0m autoboxing.
